      "title": {
        "en": "Nice to meet you"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Meeting someone, you say *miło mi* or *bardzo mi miło*, and they answer *mnie również*. The book marks each phrase *O* (formal: to *pan* or *pani*), *N* (informal: to a friend) or *U* (universal: to anyone). *Miło mi cię poznać* is for a friend, *miło mi pana poznać* for a man you call *pan*."
      },
